g. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.NonSelfIntersectionContext.E_cat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.NonSelfIntersectionContext.E_cat","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/non_self_intersection.lean#L30-L30","doc":"The categorical Möbius energy of a knot embedding `ϱ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.NonSelfIntersectionContext.q_ne_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.NonSelfIntersectionContext.q_ne_one","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/non_self_intersection.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.NonSelfIntersectionContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.NonSelfIntersectionContext.q","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/non_self_intersection.lean#L27-L27","doc":"The substrate parameter `q`, with `q ≠ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.NonSelfIntersectionContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.NonSelfIntersectionContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/non_self_intersection.lean#L25-L25","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.NonSelfIntersectionContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.NonSelfIntersectionContext","kind":"class","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/non_self_intersection.lean#L24-L36","doc":"Abstract context for the non-self-intersection divergence claim. 